# 🏴‍☠️ Pirate RPG Character Sheet — Dante D. Vance

> An interactive, responsive pirate-themed RPG character sheet built with vanilla **HTML5**, **CSS3**, and **JavaScript**, blending elements inspired by **One Piece** and **Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag**.

---

## ⚓ Creator

* **Creator:** Gabriel de Arruda França

---

## ✨ Features

* **Sticky Navigation & Mobile Drawer:** Quick jump links across sections (`About`, `Attributes`, `Inventory`, `Contact`) with a responsive hamburger drawer menu for mobile screens.
* **Light & Dark Theme Toggle:** Full theme switching across the entire layout, cards, header, footer, and inventory items.
* **Hero Overview & Expandable Lore:** Character profile for **Dante D. Vance ("O Ruivo")**, Captain of the **Gryphon** crew, bounty badge (`480,000,000 Berries`), origin details, and a toggleable full backstory.
* **Interactive XP & Leveling System:** Mission reward button (`+25 XP`) that updates the progress bar, levels up the character upon reaching `100 XP`, and resets the bar cleanly.
* **Dynamic Inventory & Category Filters:** Rendered from a JavaScript object array using `forEach` and `.filter()` (`All`, `Weapons`, `Potions`, `Treasures`, `Tools`) with item count and rarity badges.
* **Crew Recruitment Form:** Client-side form validation (`preventDefault`) checking name, valid `@` email, and message with instant visual feedback.
* **Treasure Map Side Backdrop:** Fixed treasure map background (`MARLOGO.jfif`) framing the layout behind the central cards.

---

## 🛠️ Built With

* **HTML5** — Semantic structure (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`).
* **CSS3** — CSS custom properties (`:root` & `.dark-mode`), Flexbox, CSS Grid, and responsive media queries.
* **JavaScript (ES6+)** — DOM manipulation, array filtering/rendering, state logic, and form validation.
* **Google Fonts** — *Cinzel* for headings and *Open Sans* for body text.

